# A copy of a spell is not cast (CR 707.10), so its sneak cost was not paid even when the original's was. Bot1 sneaks The Last
# Ronin's Technique in (Mox Pearl and a Plains) with the Ornithopter returned, and with it on the stack casts Lutri, the Spellchaser (flash), whose
# enters trigger copies it. The copy resolves first: three untapped tokens that are not attacking. The original then makes
# three tapped, attacking tokens, which deal 3 combat damage (Bot2 at 17); the copy's tokens deal none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
The Last Ronin's Technique
Lutri, the Spellchaser
Plains
Plains
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

